    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i put everything into this company. everything. 5 years of my life and now it's just... gone. it feels like there's this law of thermodynamics actually happening in my head. everything i build just turns to ash. it's not even bad luck anymore, it just feels like i'm biologically wired to fail. like entropy is just part of my DNA.",
