    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've never heard anyone say it like that before. usually it's just \"it gets better\" or some nonsense like that. but you're actually seeing it. seeing that maybe there isn't anything to fix or pivot. it's just... constant decay. it's exhausting to keep fighting the physics of it all. what do you mean by \"letting the wreckage settle\"?",
